  "description": "The current diagram configuration (lastId\u202f=\u202f3) is rendered at a scale of\u202f1.5 with no translation applied (translate\u202f=\u202f[0,\u202f0]).\n\nThe network contains three nodes:\n- Node\u202fA (id\u202f=\u202f1, index\u202f=\u202f0) is not fixed (fixed\u202f=\u202f0), positioned at (x\u202f=\u202f100, y\u202f=\u202f200) with pixel coordinates (px\u202f=\u202f100.5, py\u202f=\u202f200.5). Its radius is 10, its weight is 1, and its label is \u201cNode A\u201d.\n- Node\u202fB (id\u202f=\u202f2, index\u202f=\u202f1) is also not fixed (fixed\u202f=\u202f0), located at (x\u202f=\u202f300, y\u202f=\u202f400) with pixel coordinates (px\u202f=\u202f300.5, py\u202f=\u202f400.5). Its radius is the string \u201c15\u201d, its weight is 2, and its label reads \u201cNode B\u201d.\n- Node\u202fC (id\u202f=\u202f3, index\u202f=\u202f2) is fixed (fixed\u202f=\u202f1) and drawn with a dashed style (dashed\u202f=\u202ftrue). It sits at (x\u202f=\u202f500, y\u202f=\u202f600) with pixel coordinates (px\u202f=\u202f500, py\u202f=\u202f600). Its radius is 20, its weight is 3, and its label is \u201cNode C\u201d.\n\nTwo links connect these nodes:\n1. A solid link from Node\u202fA to Node\u202fB has a strength of 5, is labelled at the source with \u201cStart\u201d, at the target with \u201cEnd\u201d, and carries the central label \u201cLink\u202f1\u201d.\n2. A dashed link from Node\u202fB to Node\u202fC has a strength given by the string \u201chigh\u201d, and the link itself is marked as dashed (dashed\u202f=\u202ftrue).",
